ay</b>, known locally as \"Arugam Kudah\", is situated on the Indian Ocean in the dry zone of Sri Lanka's southeast coast, and a historic settlement of the ancient Batticaloa Territory. Arugam Kudah's literal Tamil translation is \"Bay of Cynodon dactylon\".</p>"}